1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,562
Tesla's new Roadster just jumped over a row of cars

2
00:00:03,562 --> 00:00:05,356
and did a barrel roll in midair.

3
00:00:05,356 --> 00:00:06,966
But can it actually fly?

4
00:00:06,966 --> 00:00:07,947
Not really.

5
00:00:07,947 --> 00:00:13,439
It uses cold-gas thrusters, basically giant tanks of compressed air blasting out.

6
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:16,820
Enough for jumps and flips, not for flying to work.

7
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,861
Subscribe, because here's the catch...

8
00:00:18,861 --> 00:00:21,587
Nobody was even inside during the demo.

9
00:00:21,587 --> 00:00:25,128
And Tesla itself says you can't fly it on public roads.

10
00:00:25,128 --> 00:00:28,797
So it's less flying car, more very expensive kangaroo.

11
00:00:28,797 --> 00:00:34,080
Now subscribe, unless you'd rather wait till 2028.
